<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>赛道十三 · 智慧教育</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 92, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>它不是「会不会答」，而是「每次靠不靠得住」</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>一个学习工具背后，其实是一次又一次会出岔子的过程</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 190, width: 616, height: 402, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>先说场景 · 一学期里三个时刻</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 14, gap: 14 }}>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 112, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>上课时，讲义散在三处</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
          课程平台、聊天记录、手机相册各存一半，谁也不全。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6 }}>结果：找某一页，要翻三个地方</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 112, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>写作业时，问一句就走</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
          答案留在对话框里，没有变成任何能复用的东西。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6 }}>结果：同类问题，每次都从零再问</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 112, borderLeft: '3px solid #D9534F', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>期末时，想练却没有题</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
          资料还在，但没有成套的题，只能重新翻记录。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6 }}>结果：时间全花在找东西上</Text>
      </Box>

    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 740, top: 190, width: 464, height: 402, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>再问一层 · 四个会出岔子的时刻</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 8 }}>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 92, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginTop: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>1</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, width: 420 }}>聊到一半关掉网页，回来还接得上吗？</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8, paddingLeft: 22 }}>靠「存档」——下一页</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 92 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginTop: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>2</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, width: 420 }}>查资料的接口挂了，整个回答会崩吗？</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8, paddingLeft: 22 }}>靠「兜底」——再下一页</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 92, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginTop: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>3</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, width: 420 }}>聊了两小时，还记不记得前面说过什么？</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8, paddingLeft: 22 }}>靠「纪要」——后面讲</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 92 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginTop: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>4</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, width: 420 }}>它说「帮你存好了」，真的存了？</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 8, paddingLeft: 22 }}>靠「先问你」——后面讲</Text>
      </Box>

    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 606, width: 1128, height: 48, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
      这四个时刻，工程上分别叫：中断可恢复 · 工具故障兜底 · 上下文管理 · 写操作前确认
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, bottom: 24, width: 1128, height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知迹 · 基于大模型智能体的 AI 教育学习系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>02 / 10</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
